# Report 030 (c-1): the HackBerry's case speaker connected over Bluetooth ("sound bluetooth": no local card, a sound
# server with a Bluetooth speaker's sink): the Speaker row shows, as with a card (decision C2). The HackBerry's board
# profile, its desktop session, 720x720 at its density; no backlight device there ("backlight none"): Screen has DarkTime
# alone (no Brightness row that does nothing, decision C4). A release build. Review only: no golden.
title settings speaker bluetooth hackberry
review
sizes 720x720
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_BOARD hackberry-cm5
env APPLAUNCH_SESSION desktop
env APPLAUNCH_STD_KEYBOARD 1
ppmm 670
backlight none
sound bluetooth
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch Settings
wait 300
expect_rows Screen Speaker Wi-Fi Bluetooth Launcher Touch Apps Updates User "Date & Time" System
shot settings_speaker_bluetooth_root
key ENTER
wait 300
expect_rows DarkTime
shot settings_speaker_bluetooth_screen
